B.a4f=s(["Start with just 2 minutes. That is enough.","It does not have to be perfect, just do it today too.","Every tick is a vote for the person you want to become.","Missed a day? What matters is not missing two.","Start small, but every day.","Build systems, not just goals.","1% better than yesterday."],t.s)
